      "summary": "The 1.9.1 original was a separate rule, \"Preserve an existing equivalent home and its conventions.\" The restored words are folded into \"keep bootstrap guidance in the existing docs/context/worktrees.md or another mapped worktree/bootstrap home and its conventions\", which grammatically attaches \"its\" to the second home only and reads as \"keep guidance in ... its conventions\", a weaker directive than \"preserve\". The criterion (the words \"its conventions\", keep an existing home's conventions) is met in substance.",
